<p class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Text us a photo, your city, and when you need it gone. Most of the time we quote the tier right there. For complex cleanouts (estate jobs, hoarder situations, full construction tear-outs), we come look in person first. About 15 to 30% of the time the final price lands higher than the text quote, almost always because the pile in person is bigger than the photo. We tell you the new number before we load another thing.</p>
